    "description": {
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "User story"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "As a V4 GIS user, I want to replace an unsuccessful layer search with a useful query, then clear it to resume browsing the same visible catalogue entries without changing my map."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Environment"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "https://o2intelligence-v4-dev.metricell.com/launcher\nOpen GIS using the existing test account. Use Search layers in the left-hand catalogue. No layer configuration, layer creation, or saved changes are needed."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Acceptance criteria"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bulletList",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "At the top of the catalogue, entering TEST2-no-match-rehearsal-20261013 keeps the exact query visible and shows no matching catalogue entries, including no Surveyor result."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Replacing that query with Surveyor without reloading keeps Surveyor visible in the search field and displays its matching catalogue entry."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Clearing the query leaves the search field empty and restores the same catalogue entries and browsing controls visible in the initial top-of-catalogue viewport, at the same browsing position."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The visible map retains its initial extent and scale, and the complete active-layer list retains its initial entries and order throughout the query changes and after clearing. No new layer is added."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Evidence scope"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Catalogue restoration concerns only the visible initial viewport, not every off-screen or collapsed catalogue item. Record the initial visible catalogue and matching final cleared view, plus the no-match and Surveyor result states. Map and complete active-layer comparisons need their own baseline, intermediate and final evidence; if the active-layer list requires scrolling, capture all its entries. Do not interpret the visible catalogue criterion as an assertion about the complete catalogue. Disclose pre-existing alerts separately from changes caused by the tested actions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Guide relevance"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Assess this as an ordinary ticket against the existing guide. Reuse existing guidance when it already covers the behaviour; do not force a new section."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
